/self_heal.log.*.gz
/dispatcher.log.*.gz
/ops/intervention_ledger.db
/scribe.db

# wq#1253 (#23): all mutable dispatcher runtime state lives under runtime/ dirs,
# gitignored, so lumen-pr's dirty-tree guard never false-blocks a land on a daemon's
# own state writes. config.json stays tracked and static (wq#772).
runtime/
*.err
.*.err
